notes.content:
1. This game contains a considerable degree of political content, if there are parts that do not meet your wishes, please close the game immediately;
2. This game is independently produced by the author, the author does not know the program at all, so there is no adaptation achievement, cloud save and other functions, the author wants to go on, but the technical power is really limited, hereby apologize! Authors will try to join the achievement system after the limited-time free ends. At the same time, it can only solve the bug problem in the game flow, and the problems such as installation and mismatch cannot be solved, apologize again;
3. Regarding the full-screen function, due to the incompatibility of the engine with Win10, there may be a vicious black screen of death bug, so it is not online. You can open the full screen through alt+enter, but win10 users are not recommended to try, thank you for your understanding;
4. This game is not suitable for judging by the standards of commercial works, it is just a game made by the author alone, if it is not intended to be released for free to avoid possible political turmoil, please do not be too harsh.
Thank you very much for your support!!
